 you to do an illustration of a male ooc in a similar style.\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/eaeMVGrd4RyC5Mje7\n\n^Clothing: I hope to mimic the style of the second and third pictures I provided. This is his work attire with his shirt zipped up to see the gray-green cotton inside.\n\n^ Character Profile Short black hair with blue reflections at the very ends and slightly blue eyes. Tall, 30 years old. Usually seems mild-mannered, but is unexpectedly a man in control, doing things with ease.\n\n[Usage].\nIllustration is for personal enjoyment only, thank you for reading! (\u2229_\u2229*) \u2032)\u2729", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@akuta_vi/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2126215, "client_id": 1999310, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e988758b9f5900961592279b251b9e9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e988758b9f5900961592279b251b9e9, https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c04f59d7d2620e9bf7acf7e8ed74485 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0563aad03eaa5927e5b928be6c45c233 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=475e5e6607aa5571ebcdfcb400342d4f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=475e5e6607aa5571ebcdfcb400342d4f, https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=149c1f979e19c1b44df350e7adb4549e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eceadab3/uploads/origins/e1e5d9a5-61b1-4973-a211-732ff0a748b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86f8b41f700c72d6d4623cbe789b6838 3x"}, "body": "0Preferred image: Deformed version of the rabbit-eared girl from the New Year's drawing in 2023\n(like a chibi character)\n\nIf the budget is not enough, we will add it.\n\n\n The following is not directly related to the commission, so you can skip it.\nI saw the girl with rabbit ears in the New Year's picture of 2023 on Twitter, and as soon as I heard about Akuto-sama, I fell in love with the girl with rabbit ears. I have been using the online print service and have been looking at it every day.\nWhen I learned that you accept requests from individuals, I thought I would be able to see her in a different light! I was so happy that I could see her in a different light.\nI was disappointed that she was booked up last time, but I hope she will be able to make it this time. I apologize for the length of this message.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@akuta_vi/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2126215, "client_id": 3143606, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=365e5c4dfdca2a2f61999aff2b64a002", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=365e5c4dfdca2a2f61999aff2b64a002, https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98c2da311e9e9b3dc6a2f44e8d6dab8c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=265b86ec819bb75d4a2f860b2e4c4e10 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=33dda0d85cfe2b24e89b235e43134b0a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=33dda0d85cfe2b24e89b235e43134b0a, https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6faf62546e378819a60d6f0c5b286cd3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cf9ddbbd/uploads/origins/b8951ca2-bfb4-4c65-971e-8e024b6621f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a74585de629e22f8cabff4e2306c8fa2 3x"}, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you! (*^\u25bd^*)\nAkuto-sensei's illustrations are really beautiful and I can't take my eyes off of them from the first glance! I would very much like to ask Mr. Akuto to illustrate this BL couple: ......!\nPlease be assured that your request will be used for personal viewing only!\n\n\u25bc Please refer to the character's material here ^^\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/7e9TAcFXkQXFXz7v6\n\n\u2606The image of the finished product we expect\nIf you could draw in the style of (https://x.com/akuta_vi/status/1874110956315566236), I would be very happy! I would like to ask for two illustrations roughly like this, but of course you are free to adjust the canvas size, etc! ><\n\nAbout the character\nThe one with white hair \u2192 Cold, taciturn, serious and dependable in character. However, in front of the dark-haired one, a slightly childish side can be seen.\n(Be careful! \u2192He has ahair and his pupils are cat's eyes)\n\nThe one with the black hair \u2192 He looks like he is dangling, but he has a solid side and is very outgoing. He always smiles like a cat.\n(Be careful! ) \u2192He has fine aphtha hair, a tear bruise under his left eye, and a gray hair behind his left ear)\n\n-If possible, I would appreciate it if you could draw him with his hair like the last reference image!\n(The character with black hair is in braids, the one with white hair has her hair down.)\nIf the character's outfit is not to your liking, you may simply change it to a trench coat or other clothing!\nWe would appreciate it if you could finish the drawing in the way that is most comfortable for you.\n\nThank you very much for reading! If you are not satisfied with the price, please resubmit your request. (*^\u25bd^*)\nHave a wonderful day! \u2728", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@akuta_vi/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2126215, "client_id": 882075, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f109234cc77778b015cb7c9729c5395", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origins/6b197af6-4f2e-44f0-a20f-22d987bc95c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f109234cc77778b015cb7c9729c5395, https://si.imgix.net/0dd94ab6/uploads/origin